    "id" : "@angular-eslint_component-max-inline-declarations",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce maximum lines in Angular component inline declarations",
    "description" : "Ensures that inline templates, styles, and animations in Angular components do not exceed a specified maximum number of lines.",
    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/component-max-inline-declarations.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/component-max-inline-declarations/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations`\n\nEnforces a maximum number of lines in inline template, styles and animations. See more at https://angular.io/guide/styleguide#style-05-04\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule accepts an options object with the following properties:\n\n```ts\ninterface Options {\n  /**\n   * Default: `3`\n   */\n  template?: number;\n  /**\n   * Default: `3`\n   */\n  styles?: number;\n  /**\n   * Default: `15`\n   */\n  animations?: number;\n}\n\n```\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `\n            ~\n    <div>first line</div>\n    <div>second line</div>\n    <div>third line</div>\n    <div>fourth line</div>\n  `\n  ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"template\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: '<div>first line</div>'\n            ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styles: [\n          ~\n    `\n      div {\n        display: block;\n        height: 40px;\n      }\n    `\n  ]\n  ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styles: `\n          ~\n    div {\n      display: block;\n      height: 40px;\n    }\n  `\n  ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styles: [\n          ~\n    `\n      div {\n        display: block;\n      }\n    `,\n    `\n      span {\n        width: 30px;\n      }\n    `\n  ]\n  ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"styles\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styles: ['div { display: none; }']\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  animations: [{\n              ~\n    transformPanelWrap: trigger('transformPanelWrap', [\n      transition('* => void', query('@transformPanel', [animateChild()], {optional: true})),\n    ]),\n    transformPanel: trigger('transformPanel', [\n      state('void', style({\n        transform: 'scaleY(0.8)',\n        minWidth: '100%',\n        opacity: 0\n      })),\n      state('showing', style({\n        opacity: 1,\n        minWidth: 'calc(100% + 32px)',\n        transform: 'scaleY(1)'\n      })),\n      state('next', style({height: '0px', visibility: 'hidden'}))\n    ])\n  }]\n   ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  animations: [\n              ~\n    trigger('dialogContainer', [\n      transition('* => void', query('@transformPanel', [animateChild()], {optional: true}))\n    ]),\n    trigger('transformPanel', [\n      state('void', style({\n        transform: 'scaleY(0.8)',\n        minWidth: '100%',\n        opacity: 0\n      })),\n      state('showing', style({\n        opacity: 1,\n        minWidth: 'calc(100% + 32px)',\n        transform: 'scaleY(1)'\n      }))\n    ]),\n    trigger('transformPanel', [\n      state('void', style({opacity: 0, transform: 'scale(1, 0)'}))\n    ])\n  ]\n  ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"animations\": 2\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  animations: [{\n              ~\n    transformPanel: trigger('transformPanel', [\n      state('void', style({opacity: 0, transform: 'scale(1, 0)'}))\n    ])\n  }]\n   ~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: '<div>just one line template</div>'\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styles: ['div { display: none; }']\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styles: 'div { display: none; }'\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  animations: [state('void', style({opacity: 0, transform: 'scale(1, 0)'}))]\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  styleUrls: ['./foobar.scss'],\n  templateUrl: './foobar.html',\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/component-max-inline-declarations\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  animations: [\n    state('void', style({opacity: 0, transform: 'scale(1, 0)'}))\n  ],\n  templateUrl: './foobar.html',\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 10,
