    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/directive-class-suffix.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/directive-class-suffix/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix`\n\nClasses decorated with @Directive must have suffix \"Directive\" (or custom) in their name. See more at https://angular.io/styleguide#style-02-03\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule accepts an options object with the following properties:\n\n```ts\ninterface Options {\n  /**\n   * Default: `[\"Directive\"]`\n   */\n  suffixes?: string[];\n}\n\n```\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sg-foo-bar'\n})\nclass Test {}\n      ~~~~\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sg-foo-bar'\n})\nclass TestDirectivePage implements AsyncValidator {}\n      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"suffixes\": [\n          \"Page\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sgBarFoo'\n})\nclass TestPageDirective {}\n      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sgBarFoo'\n})\nclass TestDirective {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sgBarFoo'\n})\nclass TestValidator implements Validator {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sgBarFoo'\n})\nclass TestValidator implements AsyncValidator {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  selector: 'sg-bar-foo'\n})\nclass TestComponent {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  name: 'sgPipe'\n})\nclass TestPipe {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass TestService {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass TestEmpty {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"suffixes\": [\n          \"Dir\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sgBarFoo'\n})\nclass TestDir {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/directive-class-suffix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"suffixes\": [\n          \"Page\",\n          \"View\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'sgBarFoo'\n})\nclass TestPage {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
