    "title" : "Disallow async Angular lifecycle methods",
    "description" : "Angular lifecycle methods should not be declared async because Angular does not wait for async lifecycle methods to complete.",
    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/no-async-lifecycle-method.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/no-async-lifecycle-method/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method`\n\nAngular Lifecycle methods should not be async. Angular does not wait for async lifecycle but the code incorrectly suggests it does.\n\n- Type: problem\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule does not have any configuration options.\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngAfterContentChecked() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngAfterContentInit() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngAfterViewChecked() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngAfterViewInit() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe()\nclass Test {\n  async ngDoBootstrap() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngDoCheck() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngOnChanges() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngOnDestroy() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  async ngOnInit() { }\n        ~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterContentChecked() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterContentInit() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterViewChecked() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterViewInit() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngDoBootstrap() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngDoCheck() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnChanges() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnDestroy() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnInit() { }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nasync function ngAfterContentChecked() {}\nasync function ngAfterContentInit() {}\nasync function ngAfterViewChecked() {}\nasync function ngAfterViewInit() {}\nasync function ngDoBootstrap() {}\nasync function ngDoCheck() {}\nasync function ngOnChanges() {}\nasync function ngOnDestroy() {}\nasync function ngOnInit() {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-async-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test {\n  async ngOnInit() {}\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
