    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays`\n\nEnsures that metadata arrays do not contain duplicate entries.\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule does not have any configuration options.\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  providers: [ProviderA, ProviderB, ProviderA, ProviderB]\n                                    ~~~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  declarations: [DeclarationA, DeclarationB, DeclarationA, DeclarationB],\n                                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  imports: [ImportA, ImportB, ImportA, ImportB]\n                              ~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  exports: [ExportA, ExportB, ExportA, ExportB]\n                              ~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  imports: [ImportA, ImportB, ImportA, ImportB]\n                              ~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  providers: [ProviderA, ProviderB, ProviderA, ProviderB]\n                                    ~~~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  imports: [\n    ImportA,\n    ImportB,\n    ImportA,\n    ~~~~~~~\n    ImportB,\n    ~~~~~~~\n    ImportA\n    ~~~~~~~\n  ]\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  providers: [ProviderA, ProviderB, ProviderC],\n  declarations: [DeclarationA, DeclarationB, DeclarationC],\n  imports: [ImportA, ImportB, ImportC],\n  exports: [ExportA, ExportB, ExportC]\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  imports: [ImportA, ImportB, ImportC]\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-duplicates-in-metadata-arrays\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  providers: [ProviderA, ProviderB, ProviderC],\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
