    "description" : "This rule disallows declaring empty Angular lifecycle methods in component, directive, service, or module classes.",
    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/no-empty-lifecycle-method.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/no-empty-lifecycle-method/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method`\n\nDisallows declaring empty lifecycle methods\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n- 💡 Provides suggestions on how to fix issues (https://eslint.org/docs/developer-guide/working-with-rules#providing-suggestions)\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule does not have any configuration options.\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterContentChecked() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test extends BaseDirective {\n  ngAfterContentInit() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test extends BaseTest implements AfterViewChecked, OnDestroy {\n  'ngAfterViewChecked'() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule()\nclass Test {\n  ['ngAfterViewInit']() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\nimport { HttpInterceptor } from '@angular/common/http';\nimport {\n  DoCheck,\n  DoBootstrap\n} from '@angular/core';\n@Pipe()\nclass Test {\n  [`ngDoBootstrap`]() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  AfterViewChecked,\n  DoCheck,\n  AfterViewInit,\n} from '@angular/core';\n@Component()\nclass Test\n    implements AfterViewChecked,\n                AfterViewInit,\n                DoCheck {\n  ngDoCheck() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\nimport {OnChanges, AfterContentInit} from '@angular/core';\n@Directive()\nclass Test implements OnChanges, AfterContentInit {\n  ngOnChanges() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\nimport * as ng from '@angular/core';\n@Injectable()\nclass Test implements ng.OnDestroy {\n  ngOnDestroy() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\nimport {DoBootstrap, OnInit} from '@angular/core';\n@NgModule()\nclass Test implements OnInit, DoBootstrap {\n  ngOnInit() {\n    this.init();\n  }\n}\n\n@NgModule()\nclass Test2 implements OnInit, DoBootstrap {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test extends BaseComponent<unknown> implements OnInit {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterContentChecked() { console.log('AfterContentChecked'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterContentInit() { console.log('AfterContentInit'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterViewChecked() { console.log('AfterViewChecked'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule()\nclass Test {\n  ngAfterViewInit() { console.log('AfterViewInit'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe()\nclass Test {\n  ngDoBootstrap() { console.log('DoBootstrap'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngDoCheck() { console.log('DoCheck'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnChanges() { console.log('OnChanges'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnDestroy() { console.log('OnDestroy'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnInit() { console.log('OnInit'); }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  [ngOnInit]() {}\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-empty-lifecycle-method\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
