    "id" : "@angular-eslint_no-input-prefix",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Input Property Prefixes in Angular",
    "description" : "Ensures that Angular input bindings, including aliases, do not use disallowed prefixes as configured.",
    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/no-input-prefix.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/no-input-prefix/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix`\n\nEnsures that input bindings, including aliases, are not named or prefixed by the configured disallowed prefixes\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule accepts an options object with the following properties:\n\n```ts\ninterface Options {\n  /**\n   * Default: `[]`\n   */\n  prefixes?: string[];\n}\n\n```\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  inputs: ['on']\n           ~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  outputs: [onCredit],\n  'inputs': [onLevel, `test: on`, onFunction()],\n                      ~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  ['inputs']: ['onTest: test', ...onArray],\n               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  [`inputs`]: ['onTest: test', ...onArray],\n               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Input() on: EventEmitter<any> = new EventEmitter<{}>();\n           ~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input() @Custom('on') 'onPrefix' = new EventEmitter<void>();\n                         ~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Custom() @Input(`on`) _on = getInput();\n                   ~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Custom() @Input({ required: true, alias: `on` }) _on = getInput();\n                                            ~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input('onPrefix') _on = (this.subject$ as Subject<{on: boolean}>).pipe();\n         ~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input({ alias: 'onPrefix', required: true }) _on = (this.subject$ as Subject<{on: boolean}>).pipe();\n                  ~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Input('setter') set 'on-setter'() {}\n                       ~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\",\n          \"is\",\n          \"should\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test {\n  @Input('on') isPrefix = this.getInput();\n         ~~~~  ~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Page({\n  inputs: ['on', onChange, \\`onLine\\`, 'on: on2', 'offline: on', ...onCheck, onInput()],\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  on = new EventEmitter();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input() buttonChange = new EventEmitter<'on'>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Input() On = new EventEmitter<{ on: onType }>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input(\\`one\\`) ontype = new EventEmitter<{ bar: string, on: boolean }>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input({ alias: \\`one\\` }) ontype = new EventEmitter<{ bar: string, on: boolean }>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Input('oneProp') common = new EventEmitter<ComplextOn>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Input({ alias: 'oneProp' }) common = new EventEmitter<ComplextOn>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test<On> {\n  @Input() ON = new EventEmitter<On>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nconst on = 'on';\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  @Input(on) touchMove: EventEmitter<{ action: 'on' | 'off' }> = new EventEmitter<{ action: 'on' | 'off' }>();\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"prefixes\": [\n          \"on\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nconst test = 'on';\nconst on = 'on';\n@Directive()\nclass Test {\n  @Input(test) [on]: EventEmitter<OnTest>;\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-input-prefix\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive({\n  selector: 'foo',\n})\nclass Test {\n  @Input() set 'setter'() {}\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
