    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/no-pipe-impure.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/no-pipe-impure/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure`\n\nDisallows the declaration of impure pipes\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n- 💡 Provides suggestions on how to fix issues (https://eslint.org/docs/developer-guide/working-with-rules#providing-suggestions)\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule does not have any configuration options.\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  pure: false\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  name: 'test',\n  'pure': false,\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  name: 'test',\n  ['pure']: !true\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  name: 'test',\n  [`pure`]: false\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe()\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nconst options = {};\n@Pipe(options)\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  name: 'test',\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  pure: true\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  'pure': !0,\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Pipe({\n  ['pure']: !!isPure(),\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nconst pure = 'pure';\n@Pipe({\n  [pure]: false\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nconst pure = false;\n@Pipe({\n  pure,\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nfunction isPure() {\n  return false;\n}\n\n@Pipe({\n  [`pure`]: isPure(),\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/no-pipe-impure\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule({\n  bootstrap: [Foo]\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
