    "description" : "This rule enforces using the 'providedIn' property in Angular Injectable decorators to make injectables tree-shakable.",
    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/use-injectable-provided-in.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/use-injectable-provided-in/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in`\n\nUsing the `providedIn` property makes `Injectables` tree-shakable\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n- 💡 Provides suggestions on how to fix issues (https://eslint.org/docs/developer-guide/working-with-rules#providing-suggestions)\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule accepts an options object with the following properties:\n\n```ts\ninterface Options {\n  ignoreClassNamePattern?: string;\n}\n\n```\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({})\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\nconst providedIn = 'anotherProperty';\n@Injectable({ [providedIn]: [] })\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({ providedIn: null })\n                          ~~~~\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({ ['providedIn']: undefined })\n                              ~~~~~~~~~\nclass Test {}\n\n@Injectable()\nclass HttpPostInterceptor implements HttpInterceptor {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"ignoreClassNamePattern\": \"/(Effects|NgModule)$/\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({ ['providedIn']: undefined })\n                              ~~~~~~~~~\nclass Test {}\n\n@Injectable()\nclass ProvidedInNgModule {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"ignoreClassNamePattern\": \"/(Effects|NgModule)$/\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({ [`providedIn`]: undefined })\n                              ~~~~~~~~~\nclass Test {}\n\n@Injectable()\nclass TestEffects {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nconst options = {};\n@Injectable(options)\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: `any`,\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({\n  'providedIn': 'root',\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({\n  ['providedIn']: SomeModule,\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable({\n  [`providedIn`]: providedIn(),\n})\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test implements HttpInterceptor {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test implements ng.HttpInterceptor {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Custom Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\",\n      {\n        \"ignoreClassNamePattern\": \"/Effects$/\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass TestEffects {}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-injectable-provided-in\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\n@CustomInjectable()\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
