    "id" : "@angular-eslint_use-lifecycle-interface",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce implementation of lifecycle interfaces",
    "description" : "Ensures that Angular classes implement lifecycle interfaces corresponding to the lifecycle methods they declare.",
    "explanation" : "<!--\n\n  DO NOT EDIT.\n\n  This markdown file was autogenerated using a mixture of the following files as the source of truth for its data:\n  - ../../src/rules/use-lifecycle-interface.ts\n  - ../../tests/rules/use-lifecycle-interface/cases.ts\n\n  In order to update this file, it is therefore those files which need to be updated, as well as potentially the generator script:\n  - ../../../../tools/scripts/generate-rule-docs.ts\n\n-->\n\n<br>\n\n# `@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface`\n\nEnsures that classes implement lifecycle interfaces corresponding to the declared lifecycle methods. See more at https://angular.io/styleguide#style-09-01\n\n- Type: suggestion\n\n<br>\n\n## Rule Options\n\nThe rule does not have any configuration options.\n\n<br>\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n> The following examples are generated automatically from the actual unit tests within the plugin, so you can be assured that their behavior is accurate based on the current commit.\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ - Toggle examples of <strong>incorrect</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Component()\nclass Test {\n  ngOnInit() {\n  ~~~~~~~~\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Directive()\nclass Test extends Component implements OnInit {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n\n  ngOnDestroy() {\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@Injectable()\nclass Test {\n  ngDoBootstrap() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n  ngOnInit() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~\n\n  ngOnDestroy() {}\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ❌ Invalid Code\n\n```ts\n@NgModule()\nclass Test extends Component implements ng.OnInit {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n\n  ngOnDestroy() {\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ - Toggle examples of <strong>correct</strong> code for this rule</summary>\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test implements OnInit {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test implements DoBootstrap {\n      ngDoBootstrap() {}\n    }\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test extends Component implements OnInit, OnDestroy  {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n\n  private ngOnChanges = '';\n\n  ngOnDestroy() {}\n\n  ngOnSmth() {}\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test extends Component implements ng.OnInit, ng.OnDestroy  {\n  ngOnInit() {}\n\n  private ngOnChanges = '';\n\n  ngOnDestroy() {}\n\n  ngOnSmth() {}\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n---\n\n<br>\n\n#### Default Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@angular-eslint/use-lifecycle-interface\": [\n      \"error\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n<br>\n\n#### ✅ Valid Code\n\n```ts\nclass Test {}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<br>",
