    "id" : "flowtype_type-id-match",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Flowtype Type Alias Naming Pattern",
    "description" : "This rule enforces a consistent naming pattern for Flowtype type aliases to ensure they follow a specified regular expression pattern.",
    "explanation" : "### `type-id-match`\n\nEnforces a consistent naming pattern for type aliases.\n\n#### Options\n\nThis rule requires a text RegExp:\n\n```js\n{\n    \"rules\": {\n        \"flowtype/type-id-match\": [\n            2,\n            \"^([A-Z][a-z0-9]*)+Type$\"\n        ]\n    }\n}\n```\n\n`'^([A-Z][a-z0-9]*)+Type$$'` is the default pattern.\n\n<!-- assertions typeIdMatch -->",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "flowtype_type-import-style",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Flowtype Type Import Style",
    "description" : "Enforces a consistent style for Flowtype type imports, either using 'identifier' style or 'declaration' style.",
    "explanation" : "### `type-import-style`\n\n_The `--fix` option on the command line automatically fixes problems reported by this rule._\n\nEnforces a particular style for type imports:\n\n```\n// 'identifier' style\nimport {type T, type U, type V} from '...';\n\n// 'declaration' style\nimport type {T, U, V} from '...';\n```\n\n#### Options\n\nThe rule has a string option:\n\n* `\"identifier\"` (default): Enforces that type imports are all in the\n  'identifier' style.\n* `\"declaration\"`: Enforces that type imports are all in the 'declaration'\n  style.\n\nThis rule has an object option:\n\n* `ignoreTypeDefault` - if `true`, when in \"identifier\" mode, default type imports will be ignored. Default is `false`.\n\n<!-- assertions typeImportStyle -->",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "flowtype_union-intersection-spacing",
