    "id" : "jsonc_key-spacing",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce consistent key spacing in JSON object literals",
    "description" : "This rule enforces consistent spacing between keys and values in JSON object literal properties.",
    "explanation" : "---\npageClass: \"rule-details\"\nsidebarDepth: 0\ntitle: \"jsonc/key-spacing\"\ndescription: \"enforce consistent spacing between keys and values in object literal properties\"\nsince: \"v0.1.0\"\n---\n\n# jsonc/key-spacing\n\n> enforce consistent spacing between keys and values in object literal properties\n\n- :wrench: The `--fix` option on the [command line](https://eslint.org/docs/user-guide/command-line-interface#fixing-problems) can automatically fix some of the problems reported by this rule.\n\n## :book: Rule Details\n\nThis rule enforces consistent spacing between keys and values in object literal properties. In the case of long lines, it is acceptable to add a new line wherever whitespace is allowed.\n\n<eslint-code-block fix>\n\n<!-- eslint-skip -->\n\n```json5\n/* eslint jsonc/key-spacing: 'error' */\n{\n    /* ✓ GOOD */\n    \"GOOD\": \"foo\",\n\n    /* ✗ BAD */\n    \"BAD\" :\"bar\"\n}\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n## :wrench: Options\n\n```json\n{\n    \"jsonc/key-spacing\": [\"error\",\n        {\n            \"beforeColon\": false,\n            \"afterColon\": true,\n            \"mode\": \"strict\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\nSame as [key-spacing] rule option. See [here](https://eslint.org/docs/rules/key-spacing#options) for details.\n\n## :couple: Related rules\n\n- [key-spacing]\n\n[key-spacing]: https://eslint.org/docs/rules/key-spacing\n\n## :rocket: Version\n\nThis rule was introduced in eslint-plugin-jsonc v0.1.0\n\n## :mag: Implementation\n\n- [Rule source](https://github.com/ota-meshi/eslint-plugin-jsonc/blob/master/lib/rules/key-spacing.ts)\n- [Test source](https://github.com/ota-meshi/eslint-plugin-jsonc/blob/master/tests/lib/rules/key-spacing.ts)\n\n<sup>Taken with ❤️ [from ESLint core](https://eslint.org/docs/rules/key-spacing)</sup>",
