  {
    "id" : "jsx-a11y_iframe-has-title",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce iframe elements to have a title attribute",
    "description" : "This rule enforces that all <iframe> elements have a unique, non-empty title attribute to describe their content.",
    "explanation" : "# jsx-a11y/iframe-has-title\n\n💼 This rule is enabled in the following configs: ☑️ `recommended`, 🔒 `strict`.\n\n<!-- end auto-generated rule header -->\n\n`<iframe>` elements must have a unique title property to indicate its content to the user.\n\n## Rule details\n\nThis rule takes no arguments.\n\n### Succeed\n```jsx\n<iframe title=\"This is a unique title\" />\n<iframe title={uniqueTitle} />\n```\n\n### Fail\n```jsx\n<iframe />\n<iframe {...props} />\n<iframe title=\"\" />\n<iframe title={''} />\n<iframe title={``} />\n<iframe title={undefined} />\n<iframe title={false} />\n<iframe title={true} />\n<iframe title={42} />\n```\n\n## Accessibility guidelines\n- [WCAG 2.4.1](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Understanding/bypass-blocks)\n- [WCAG 4.1.2](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Understanding/name-role-value)\n\n### Resources\n- [axe-core, frame-title](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/3.2/frame-title)",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
