    "title" : "Disallow Connectable Observables in RxJS",
    "description" : "This rule forbids the use of operators that return connectable observables in RxJS.",
    "explanation" : "# Avoid connectable observables (`no-connectable`)\n\nThis rule prevents the use of connectable observables.\n\n## Options\n\nThis rule has no options.",
