  {
    "id" : "rxjs_no-subject-unsubscribe",
    "level" : "High",
    "category" : "ErrorProne",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Unsubscribe Method on RxJS Subjects",
    "description" : "Prevents calling the unsubscribe method on RxJS subject instances.",
    "explanation" : "# Avoid calling `unsubscribe` on subjects (`no-subject-unsubscribe`)\n\nThis rule effects failures if the `unsubscribe` method is called on subjects. The method behaves differently to the `unsubsribe` method on subscriptions and is often an error.\n\n## Options\n\nThis rule has no options.\n\n## Further reading\n\n- [Closed Subjects](https://ncjamieson.com/closed-subjects/)",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
