    "description" : "This rule forbids accessing the `value` property or `getValue` method of a `BehaviorSubject` instance in RxJS.",
    "explanation" : "# Avoid using a behavior subject's value (`no-subject-value`)\n\nThis rule effects an error if the `value` property - or `getValue` method - of a `BehaviorSubject` is used.\n\n## Options\n\nThis rule has no options.",
