    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow use of toPromise in RxJS",
    "description" : "This rule forbids the use of the `toPromise` method in RxJS code.",
    "explanation" : "# Avoid `toPromise` (`no-topromise`)\n\nThis rule effects failures if the `toPromise` method is used.\n\n## Options\n\nThis rule has no options.",
    "enabled" : false,
