  {
    "id" : "@stylistic_type-generic-spacing",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce consistent spacing inside TypeScript type generics",
    "description" : "This rule enforces consistent spacing inside the angle brackets of TypeScript type generics.",
    "explanation" : "# plus/type-generic-spacing\n\nEnforces consistent spacing inside TypeScript type generics.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nThis rule enforces consistent spacing inside TypeScript type generics.\n\n## Options\n\nThis rule has no options.\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n:::incorrect\n\n```ts\n/*eslint type-generic-spacing: [\"error\"]*/\n\ntype Foo<T=true> = T\ntype Foo<T,K> = T\n\ninterface Log {\n  foo <T>(name: T): void\n}\n```\n\n:::\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n:::correct\n\n```ts\n/*eslint type-generic-spacing: [\"error\"]*/\n\ntype Foo<T = true> = T\ntype Foo<T, K> = T\n\ninterface Log {\n  foo<T>(name: T): void\n}\n```\n\n:::",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
