    "description" : "This rule enforces the presence of a 'data-test-id' attribute on all <a> (anchor) elements to facilitate testing.",
    "explanation" : "# Requires the `data-test-id` attribute on <a> elements.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<a href=\"example.com\">Download</a>\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<a href=\"example.com\" data-test-id=\"download-link\">Download</a>\n```",
