  {
    "id" : "vue_define-macros-order",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Vue Define Macros Order",
    "description" : "This rule enforces the order of Vue compiler macros (such as defineProps, defineEmits) in <script setup> blocks, ensuring they appear first and in a specified sequence.",
    "explanation" : "---\npageClass: rule-details\nsidebarDepth: 0\ntitle: vue/define-macros-order\ndescription: enforce order of compiler macros (`defineProps`, `defineEmits`, etc.)\nsince: v8.7.0\n---\n\n# vue/define-macros-order\n\n> enforce order of compiler macros (`defineProps`, `defineEmits`, etc.)\n\n- :wrench: The `--fix` option on the [command line](https://eslint.org/docs/user-guide/command-line-interface#fixing-problems) can automatically fix some of the problems reported by this rule.\n- :bulb: Some problems reported by this rule are manually fixable by editor [suggestions](https://eslint.org/docs/developer-guide/working-with-rules#providing-suggestions).\n\n## :book: Rule Details\n\nThis rule reports compiler macros (like `defineProps` or `defineEmits` but also custom ones) when they are not the first statements in `<script setup>` (after any potential import statements or type definitions) or when they are not in the correct order.\n\n## :wrench: Options\n\n```json\n{\n  \"vue/define-macros-order\": [\"error\", {\n    \"order\": [\"defineProps\", \"defineEmits\"],\n    \"defineExposeLast\": false\n  }]\n}\n```\n\n- `order` (`string[]`) ... The order in which the macros should appear. The default is `[\"defineProps\", \"defineEmits\"]`.\n- `defineExposeLast` (`boolean`) ... Force `defineExpose` at the end.\n\n### `{ \"order\": [\"defineProps\", \"defineEmits\"] }` (default)\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✓ GOOD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<script setup>\nconst bar = ref()\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n### `{ \"order\": [\"defineOptions\", \"defineModel\", \"defineProps\", \"defineEmits\", \"defineSlots\"] }`\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {order: ['defineOptions', 'defineModel', 'defineProps', 'defineEmits', 'defineSlots']}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✓ GOOD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineOptions({/* ... */})\nconst model = defineModel()\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\nconst slots = defineSlots()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {order: ['defineOptions', 'defineModel', 'defineProps', 'defineEmits', 'defineSlots']}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\nconst slots = defineSlots()\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineOptions({/* ... */})\nconst model = defineModel()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {order: ['defineOptions', 'defineModel', 'defineProps', 'defineEmits', 'defineSlots']}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<script setup>\nconst bar = ref()\ndefineOptions({/* ... */})\nconst model = defineModel()\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\nconst slots = defineSlots()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n### `{ \"order\": [\"definePage\", \"defineModel\", \"defineCustom\", \"defineEmits\", \"defineSlots\"] }`\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {order: ['definePage', 'defineModel', 'defineCustom', 'defineEmits', 'defineSlots']}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✓ GOOD -->\n<script setup>\ndefinePage()\nconst model = defineModel()\ndefineCustom()\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\nconst slots = defineSlots()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {order: ['definePage', 'defineModel', 'defineCustom', 'defineEmits', 'defineSlots']}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\nconst slots = defineSlots()\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineCustom({/* ... */})\nconst model = defineModel()\ndefinePage()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n### `{ \"defineExposeLast\": true }`\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {defineExposeLast: true}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✓ GOOD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\nconst slots = defineSlots()\ndefineExpose({/* ... */})\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/define-macros-order': ['error', {defineExposeLast: true}]}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<script setup>\ndefineProps(/* ... */)\ndefineEmits(/* ... */)\ndefineExpose({/* ... */})\nconst slots = defineSlots()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n## :rocket: Version\n\nThis rule was introduced in eslint-plugin-vue v8.7.0\n\n## :mag: Implementation\n\n- [Rule source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/lib/rules/define-macros-order.js)\n- [Test source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/tests/lib/rules/define-macros-order.js)",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vue_define-props-declaration",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Vue defineProps Declaration Style",
    "description" : "This rule enforces the usage style of the Vue 3 Composition API function `defineProps` in setup scripts with TypeScript, requiring either type-based or runtime declaration style consistently.",
    "explanation" : "---\npageClass: rule-details\nsidebarDepth: 0\ntitle: vue/define-props-declaration\ndescription: enforce declaration style of `defineProps`\nsince: v9.5.0\n---\n\n# vue/define-props-declaration\n\n> enforce declaration style of `defineProps`\n\n## :book: Rule Details\n\nThis rule enforces `defineProps` typing style which you should use `type-based` or `runtime` declaration.\n\nThis rule only works in setup script and `lang=\"ts\"`.\n\n<eslint-code-block :rules=\"{'vue/define-props-declaration': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\n/* ✓ GOOD */\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  kind: string\n  options: { title: string }\n}>()\n\n/* ✗ BAD */\nconst props = defineProps({\n  kind: { type: String },\n  options: { type: Object as PropType<{ title: string }> }\n})\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n## :wrench: Options\n\n```json\n  \"vue/define-props-declaration\": [\"error\", \"type-based\" | \"runtime\"]\n```\n\n- `type-based` (default) enforces type-based declaration\n- `runtime` enforces runtime declaration\n\n### `\"runtime\"`\n\n<eslint-code-block :rules=\"{'vue/define-props-declaration': ['error', 'runtime']}\">\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\n/* ✓ GOOD */\nconst props = defineProps({\n  kind: { type: String },\n  options: { type: Object as PropType<{ title: string }> }\n})\n\n/* ✗ BAD */\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  kind: string\n  options: { title: string }\n}>()\n</script>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n## :couple: Related Rules\n\n- [vue/define-emits-declaration](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/tree/master/docs/rules/define-emits-declaration.md)\n- [vue/valid-define-props](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/tree/master/docs/rules/valid-define-props.md)\n\n## :books: Further Reading\n\n- [`defineProps`](https://vuejs.org/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits)\n- [Typescript-only-features of `defineProps`](https://vuejs.org/api/sfc-script-setup.html#typescript-only-features)\n- [Guide - Typing-component-props](https://vuejs.org/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props)\n\n## :rocket: Version\n\nThis rule was introduced in eslint-plugin-vue v9.5.0\n\n## :mag: Implementation\n\n- [Rule source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/lib/rules/define-props-declaration.js)\n- [Test source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/tests/lib/rules/define-props-declaration.js)",
