    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vue_no-empty-component-block",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "ErrorProne",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Empty Vue Component Blocks",
    "description" : "This rule disallows empty <template>, <script>, or <style> blocks in Vue single-file components, including blocks with empty src attributes.",
    "explanation" : "---\npageClass: rule-details\nsidebarDepth: 0\ntitle: vue/no-empty-component-block\ndescription: disallow the `<template>` `<script>` `<style>` block to be empty\nsince: v7.0.0\n---\n\n# vue/no-empty-component-block\n\n> disallow the `<template>` `<script>` `<style>` block to be empty\n\n- :wrench: The `--fix` option on the [command line](https://eslint.org/docs/user-guide/command-line-interface#fixing-problems) can automatically fix some of the problems reported by this rule.\n\n## :book: Rule Details\n\nThis rule disallows the `<template>` `<script>` `<style>` block to be empty.\n\nThis rule also checks block what has attribute `src`.\nSee [Vue Single-File Component (SFC) Spec](https://vue-loader.vuejs.org/spec.html#src-imports).\n\n<eslint-code-block fix :rules=\"{'vue/no-empty-component-block': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- ✓ GOOD -->\n<template>\n  <p>foo</p>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nconsole.log('foo')\n</script>\n\n<style>\np {\n  display: inline;\n}\n</style>\n\n<template src=\"./template.html\"></template>\n<template src=\"./template.html\" />\n\n<script src=\"./script.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"./script.js\" />\n\n<style src=\"./style.css\"></style>\n<style src=\"./style.css\" />\n\n<!-- ✗ BAD -->\n<template></template>\n<template />\n<template src=\"\" />\n\n<script></script>\n<script />\n<script src=\"\" />\n\n<style></style>\n<style />\n<style src=\"\" />\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n## :wrench: Options\n\nNothing.\n\n## :rocket: Version\n\nThis rule was introduced in eslint-plugin-vue v7.0.0\n\n## :mag: Implementation\n\n- [Rule source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/lib/rules/no-empty-component-block.js)\n- [Test source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/tests/lib/rules/no-empty-component-block.js)",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
