    "id" : "vuetify_grid-unknown-attributes",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Unknown Attributes on Vuetify Grid Components",
    "description" : "Warns about usage of unknown attributes on Vuetify v2 grid components that are not converted to classes.",
    "explanation" : "# warn about unknown attributes not being converted to classes on new grid components (grid-unknown-attributes)\n\n:wrench: This rule is fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\nThe new grid system in Vuetify v2 no longer converts unrecognised attributes into classes.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nThis rule prevents the use of non-prop attributes on `v-container`, `v-row`, and `v-col`. It will not transform legacy grid props on the new components, for that use the `no-legacy-grid` rule.\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-container fill-height></v-container>\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```js\n<v-container class=\"fill-height\">\n<v-col xs12></v-col>\n```\n\n### Options\n\nThis rule has no configuration options.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vuetify_icon-button-variant",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Icon Button Variant in Vuetify",
    "description" : "Ensure that Vuetify icon buttons have a variant property defined.",
    "explanation" : "# Ensure icon buttons have a variant defined (icon-button-variant)\n\n:wrench: This rule is fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\n## Rule Details\n\nButtons in Vuetify 3 no longer have a different variant applied automatically.\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-btn icon />\n<v-btn icon=\"search\" />\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```js\n<v-btn icon variant=\"text\" />\n<v-btn icon=\"search\" variant=\"text\" />\n```\n\n### Options\n\nA different variant other than `text` can be assigned:\n\n```js\n{\n  'vuetify/icon-button-variant': ['error', 'plain']\n}\n```",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vuetify_no-deprecated-classes",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "Compatibility",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Deprecated Vuetify Classes",
    "description" : "This rule disallows the use of CSS utility classes that have been removed or deprecated in Vuetify versions 2 and 2.3.",
    "explanation" : "# Disallow the use of classes that have been removed from Vuetify (no-deprecated-classes)\n\n:wrench: This rule is fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\nVuetify v2 and v2.3 changed several utility classes (documented [here](https://vuetifyjs.com/en/getting-started/upgrade-guide/#grid)).\n\n\n## Rule Details\n\nThis rule disallows the use of removed utility classes.\n\nSome of the changes cannot be detected automatically, you should apply these yourself:\n\n- Change spacing helpers to intervals of 4px\n  - ma-3 -> ma-4\n  - ma-4 -> ma-6\n  - ma-5 -> ma-12\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"text-xs-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"left\"></div>\n<v-container scroll-y></v-container>\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```js\n<div class=\"text-left\"></div>\n<div class=\"float-left\"></div>\n<v-container overflow-y-visible></v-container>\n```\n\n### Options\n\nThis rule has no configuration options.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vuetify_no-deprecated-colors",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Deprecated Vuetify Color Classes",
    "description" : "This rule disallows the use of deprecated color classes in Vuetify components and elements.",
    "explanation" : "# Disallow the use of the old color class structure (no-deprecated-colors)\n\n:wrench: This rule is fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-btn color=\"primary darken-1\">\n<div class=\"primary\"></div>\n<div class=\"primary--text\"></div>\n<div class=\"primary--text text--darken-1\"></div>\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```js\n<v-btn color=\"primary\">\n<v-btn color=\"primary-darken-1\">\n<div class=\"bg-primary\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-primary\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-primary-darken-1\"></div>\n```\n\n### Options\n\nAdditional custom theme colors can be added to the rule configuration:\n\n```js\n{\n  'vuetify/no-deprecated-colors': ['error', {\n    themeColors: ['tertiary']\n  }]\n}\n```",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vuetify_no-deprecated-components",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "Compatibility",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Use of Deprecated Vuetify Components",
    "description" : "This rule prevents the use of Vuetify components that have been removed or deprecated in the framework.",
    "explanation" : "# Disallow the use of components that have been removed from Vuetify (no-deprecated-components)\n\n:wrench: This rule is partially fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\n## Rule Details\n\nThis rule disallows the use of removed and deprecated components. Grid components are not included in this rule, use [`no-legacy-grid`](https://github.com/vuetifyjs/eslint-plugin-vuetify/tree/refs/tags/master/docs/rules/no-legacy-grid.md) instead.\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-content>\n  <v-list-tile>\n    <v-list-tile-title></v-list-tile-title>\n  </v-list-tile>\n</v-content>\n\n<v-jumbotron></v-jumbotron>\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-main>\n  <v-list-item>\n    <v-list-item-title></v-list-item-title>\n  </v-list-item>\n</v-main>\n```\n\n### Options\n\nThis rule has no configuration options.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 10,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "vuetify_no-deprecated-events",
    "level" : "High",
    "category" : "Compatibility",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Deprecated Vuetify Events",
    "description" : "This rule prevents the use of events that have been removed or deprecated in Vuetify components.",
    "explanation" : "# Disallow the use of events that have been removed from Vuetify (no-deprecated-events)\n\n:wrench: This rule is partially fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\n## Rule Details\n\nThis rule disallows the use of removed and deprecated events. \n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-text-field @input=\"onInput\" />\n<v-btn @change=\"onSelected\" />\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-text-field @update:model-value=\"onInput\" />\n<v-btn @group:selected=\"onSelected\" />\n```\n\n### Options\n\nThis rule has no configuration options.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
