  {
    "id" : "vuetify_no-deprecated-slots",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "Compatibility",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Prevent Use of Deprecated Vuetify Slots",
    "description" : "This rule prevents the use of removed and deprecated slot variables in Vuetify components to ensure compatibility with the latest API.",
    "explanation" : "# Prevent the use of removed slot variables (no-deprecated-slots)\n\n:wrench: This rule is partially fixable with `eslint --fix`\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-dialog>\n  <template #activator=\"{ on }\">\n    <v-btn v-on=\"on\" />\n  </template>\n</v-dialog>\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```html\n<v-dialog>\n  <template #activator=\"{ props }\">\n    <v-btn v-bind=\"props\" />\n  </template>\n</v-dialog>\n```\n\nVariable shadowing is not currently handled, the following will produce incorrect output that must be fixed manually:\n\n```html\n<v-menu>\n  <template #activator=\"{ on: menuOn }\">\n    <v-tooltip>\n      <template #activator=\"{ on: tooltipOn }\">\n        <v-btn v-on=\"{ ...tooltipOn, ...menuOn }\" />\n      </template>\n    </v-tooltip>\n  </template>\n</v-menu>\n```\n\n### Options\n\nThis rule has no configuration options.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
